{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "bakery-api-collection-2026-lao",
    "name": "Sweet Crumb Bakery API (ພາສາລາວ)",
    "description": "API ສຳລັບເບິ່ງ ແລະ ຈັດການຂໍ້ມູນຮ້ານເຂົ້າໜົມ (ສິນຄ້າ, ລູກຄ້າ, ຄຳສັ່ງຊື້) ເທິງ Postman ເປັນພາສາລາວ",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. ສິນຄ້າ (Products)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "ດຶງສິນຄ້າທັງໝົດ (Get All Products)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/products",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "products"]
            },
            "description": "ເບິ່ງລາຍການເຂົ້າໜົມທັງໝົດໃນຮ້ານ ພ້ອມລາຄາ, ຮູບພາບ ແລະ ຈຳນວນສະຕັອກຍັງເຫຼືອ"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "ຄົ້ນຫາເຂົ້າໜົມຕາມຊື່ (Search Products)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/products?search=ຄົວຊອງ",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "products"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "search",
                  "value": "ຄົວຊອງ",
                  "description": "ຄຳຄົ້ນຫາ ເຊັ່ນ: ຄົວຊອງ, ເຄັກ, ຊັອກໂກແລັດ"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "ຄົ້ນຫາເຂົ້າໜົມຕາມຄຳຄົ້ນຫາ"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "ກັ່ນຕອງສິນຄ້າຕາມໝວດໝູ່ (Filter Category)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/products?category=ເຄັກ",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "products"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "category",
                  "value": "ເຄັກ",
                  "description": "ໝວດໝູ່: ເຂົ້າໜົມປັງ, ເຄັກ, ເຂົ້າໜົມຫວານ"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "ກັ່ນຕອງສິນຄ້າຕາມໝວດໝູ່"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "ເບິ່ງສິນຄ້າຕາມ ID (Get Product by ID)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/products/1",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "products", "1"]
            },
            "description": "ເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດສິນຄ້າອັນທີ 1"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. ລູກຄ້າ (Customers)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "ເບິ່ງລາຍຊື່ລູກຄ້າທັງໝົດ (Get All Customers)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/customers",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "customers"]
            },
            "description": "ເບິ່ງລາຍຊື່ລູກຄ້າທັງໝົດ ພ້ອມສະຖິຕິຈຳນວນຄັ້ງທີ່ສັ່ງ ແລະ ຍອດເງິນລວມ"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "ຄົ້ນຫາລູກຄ້າຕາມຊື່ ຫຼື ເບີໂທ (Search Customers)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/customers?search=ສົມໄຊ",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "customers"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "search",
                  "value": "ສົມໄຊ",
                  "description": "ຊື່ ຫຼື ເບີໂທລູກຄ້າ"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "ຄົ້ນຫາລູກຄ້າໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "ເພີ່ມລູກຄ້າໃໝ່ (Create Customer)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"ມະນີວອນ ຄຳມະນີ\",\n  \"phone\": \"020 77665544\",\n  \"address\": \"ບ້ານໜອງບອນ, ເມືອງໄຊເສດຖາ, ນະຄອນຫຼວງວຽງຈັນ\",\n  \"note\": \"ມັກຊູຄຣີມຫຼາຍ\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/customers",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "customers"]
            },
            "description": "ເພີ່ມຂໍ້ມູນລູກຄ້າໃໝ່ລົງຖານຂໍ້ມູນ"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. ຄຳສັ່ງຊື້ (Orders)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "ເບິ່ງລາຍການສັ່ງຊື້ທັງໝົດ (Get All Orders)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/orders",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "orders"]
            },
            "description": "ເບິ່ງປະຫວັດຄຳສັ່ງຊື້ທັງໝົດທີ່ລູກຄ້າສັ່ງ"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "ສ້າງຄຳສັ່ງຊື້ໃໝ່ (Create Order)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"customer_id\": 1,\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"product_id\": 1,\n      \"quantity\": 2\n    },\n    {\n      \"product_id\": 2,\n      \"quantity\": 1\n    }\n  ]\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/orders",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "orders"]
            },
            "description": "ສ້າງຄຳສັ່ງຊື້ໃໝ່ (ລະບົບຈະຄິດໄລ່ລາຄາ ແລະ ຕັດສະຕັອກສິນຄ້າອັດຕະໂນມັດ)"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ]
}
